Z||000000||Smokey||11-05-2000||01:25 PM||||What does everyone think of bosch platinum plugs? I've heard some people say they are a waste of money. I think otherwise. When I bought my Fiero, it had a horrible hessitation up untill 3,000rmps and then it smoothed out. for the longest time I couldn't get rid of this problem. I had tried 4 different kinds of spark plugs in my car and none of them helped one bit. A fellow fiero owner and friend told me to try some Bosch Platinums in her. So I went to the local auto parts store the next day and got my plugs. I installed em and immediatlely the hessitation stopped and I never noticed a problem again. what do u guys think?||||reg||5
